WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.427
In under two minutes, you will score the homes in a contest, starting from your invitation email.

00:00:06.328 --> 00:00:08.340
This is your invitation email.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:11.716
It says which contest it is, and how judging works.

00:00:11.716 --> 00:00:13.468
Tap Open my judges' ballot.

00:00:16.238 --> 00:00:17.469
This is your ballot.

00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:21.161
It says when voting closes, and how many scores you have given.

00:00:22.062 --> 00:00:23.295
Tap Visit the homes.

00:00:23.295 --> 00:00:26.641
A long list is split into routes of nine stops or fewer.

00:00:26.641 --> 00:00:31.397
Each route starts where the last one ended, and you tick off each home as you go.

00:00:33.226 --> 00:00:34.294
Tap a category.

00:00:34.294 --> 00:00:36.431
Every home is in every category.

00:00:38.266 --> 00:00:39.365
Know a household?

00:00:39.365 --> 00:00:41.013
Tap I know this household.

00:00:41.013 --> 00:00:42.295
That home is skipped.

00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:46.714
Score each of the other homes, one to ten.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.934
Tap Ballot to see your progress.

00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:53.975
Your scores stay private until winners are announced.

00:00:55.756 --> 00:00:58.566
Next up: Create a contest in two minutes.
